    },
    {
      "id": "6a4hH-Gx2NVLG9_4YtYDt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17797.4269510905,
      "y": 255.26190476190436,
      "width": 477.5196228027344,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 894521664,
      "version": 63,
      "versionNonce": 1922353856,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786515825592,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u0130hale \u015Eartlar\u0131 b\u00F6l\u00FCm\u00FCn\u00FCn uzat\u0131lmas\u0131 gerekmektedir.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u0130hale \u015Eartlar\u0131 b\u00F6l\u00FCm\u00FCn\u00FCn uzat\u0131lmas\u0131 gerekmektedir.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5RnJZvDLEFrWF3D6moDEa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17798.90154054032,
      "y": 300.26190476190436,
      "width": 742.9193115234375,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1532608,
      "version": 63,
      "versionNonce": 1306396154,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786519481885,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u0130hale \u015Eartlar\u0131 ve \u0130stenilecek Belgeler b\u00F6l\u00FCmleri hem \u00273. \u0130hale De\u011Ferlendirme\nKriterlerinde De\u011Fi\u015Fiklik\u0027.b\u00F6l\u00FCmde hemde \u00274. \u0130dari De\u011Fi\u015Fiklik (\u0130stenen Belgelerde\nDe\u011Fi\u015Fiklik)\u0027.b\u00F6l\u00FCmde gelmektedir. 2\u0027sininde gelmesi durumunda yaln\u0131zca 1 kere\ng\u00F6sterilmesi gerekmektedir.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u0130hale \u015Eartlar\u0131 ve \u0130stenilecek Belgeler b\u00F6l\u00FCmleri hem \u00273. \u0130hale De\u011Ferlendirme Kriterlerinde De\u011Fi\u015Fiklik\u0027.b\u00F6l\u00FCmde hemde \u00274. \u0130dari De\u011Fi\u015Fiklik (\u0130stenen Belgelerde De\u011Fi\u015Fiklik)\u0027.b\u00F6l\u00FCmde gelmektedir. 2\u0027sininde gelmesi durumunda yaln\u0131zca 1 kere g\u00F6sterilmesi gerekmektedir.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "l7QWFsznb5v_1UGTYrwZB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17797.4269510905,
      "y": 418.8333333333329,
      "width": 692.659423828125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 966076736,
      "version": 66,
      "versionNonce": 2106490790,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786516153589,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sekme alt\u0131ndaki Kaydet butonunun Kaydet \u0130lerle olarak g\u00FCncellenmesi\ngerekmektedir. T\u0131kland\u0131\u011F\u0131nda Dosyalar sekmesinin a\u00E7\u0131lmas\u0131 gerekmektedir.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sekme alt\u0131ndaki Kaydet butonunun Kaydet \u0130lerle olarak g\u00FCncellenmesi gerekmektedir. T\u0131kland\u0131\u011F\u0131nda Dosyalar sekmesinin a\u00E7\u0131lmas\u0131 gerekmektedir.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
